chnology Management + AI - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bachelor-of-business-administration-bfsi-banking-financial-services--insurance\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - BFSI (Banking, Financial Services \u0026 Insurance) - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/imba-entrepreneurship\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - Entrepreneurship, Family Business \u0026 Sustainability - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bachelor-of-business-administration-event-management\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - Event Management - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bba-mba---international-trade--finance\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - iTrade \u0026 Finance - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bachelor-of-business-administration-public-administration-upsc--gpsc-curriculum\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - Public Administration (UPSC/GPSC) - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n            \u003c/ul\u003e\r\n        \u003c/div\u003e\r\n    \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003c!-- School of Investigative and Applied Sciences --\u003e\r\n    \u003cdiv class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"\u003e\r\n        \u003cdiv class=\"footer-item\"\u003e\r\n            \u003ch5 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 20px;\"\u003eSchool of Investigative and Applied Sciences (SIAS)\u003c/h5\u003e\r\n            \u003cul class=\"footer-item-links\" style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bsc--bsc-hons--imsc-forensic-science--technology\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iM.Sc. - Forensic Science - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated B.Sc. + M.Sc. Forensic Science\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bsc--bsc-hons--imsc--cyber--digital-forensic\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iM.Sc. - Cyber Security \u0026 Digital Forensics - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated B.Sc. + M.Sc. Cyber Security \u0026 Digital Forensics\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bsc--bsc-hons--imsc--clinical-embryology--reproductive-biology\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iM.Sc. - Reproductive Biology \u0026 Clinical Embryology - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated B.Sc. + M.Sc. Reproductive Biology \u0026 Clinical Embryology\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bsc--bsc-hons--imsc--food-nutrition-amp-lifestyle-science\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        B.Sc./B.Sc. (Hons.)/iMSc