g: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        BBA (Hons) - 4 years, 8 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eBachelor of Business Administration\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/integrated-bba-mba\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        Integrated BBA + MBA - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bachelor-of-business-administration-applied-technology-management--artificial-intelligence\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - Applied Technology Management + AI - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bachelor-of-business-administration-bfsi-banking-financial-services--insurance\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - BFSI (Banking, Financial Services \u0026 Insurance) - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/imba-entrepreneurship\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - Entrepreneurship, Family Business \u0026 Sustainability - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bachelor-of-business-administration-event-management\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - Event Management - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bba-mba---international-trade--finance\" style=\"color: #000; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 6px 0;\"\u003e\r\n                        iMBA - iTrade \u0026 Finance - 5 years, 10 semesters\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #444; display: block; margin-top: 3px;\"\u003eIntegrated BBA (Hons) + MBA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\r\n                \u003c/li\u003e\r\n                \u003cli style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\r\n                    \u003ca href=\"https://jguni.edu.in/view-page/bachelor-of-business-administration-public-administration-upsc--gpsc-curriculum\" 